   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
            <pb n="1" facs="Edgeworth_Princeton_1834-07-04_copy_page01.pdf"/>
            <opener>
               <salute> Copy of <persName ref="./Personography.xml#EdgeM1">ME's</persName><lb/>
                  <persName ref="./Personography.xml#BentR1" cert="high">Sir</persName>
               </salute>
            </opener>
            <p>I am glad to hear that you approve all the sale<lb/> of the number of copies of
                  <title ref="./Workography.xml#Helen1">Helen</title> which enable<lb/> you to
               transmit to me the promissory note<lb/> you mention for £200 Whenever you are
               ready<lb/> I beg you will give the note to my brother in<lb/> law <persName
                  ref="./Personography.xml#WilsL1">L. P. Wilson</persName> by <placeName
                  ref="./Placeography.xml#North-Audley-Street-1_ENK">N<hi rend="superscript">o</hi>.
                  1 North Audley Street</placeName><lb/> or to <persName
                  ref="./Personography.xml#EdgeF3">M<hi rend="superscript">rs</hi>.
                  Wilson</persName> whichever of them happen to<lb/> be at home - Either of them
               will give you a rec<hi rend="superscript">t</hi><lb/> for me.</p>

            <p>I have every reason to be satisfied with the manner<lb/> in which you have brought
               out this book<lb/> and am obliged by the <del>readiness</del>
               <add>promptness</add> and<lb/> care with which you have can complied with<lb/> my
               wishes as to presentation copies and<lb/> on all of other points as well as with
               your<lb/> punctuality in fulfilling your agreement<lb/> as to money matters</p>

            <p>I will let you know whenever I am<lb/> again ready to go to press But I make it
               a<lb/> rule never to enter into any agreement<lb/> or to give any promise for a manuscript<lb/>
               <unclear>till</unclear> it is absolutely finished - I have none<lb/> at present even
               approaching to that condition<lb/> nor can I tell when I may be ready to publish<lb/>
               again</p>
            <closer> I am Sir<lb/> Your <choice>
                  <orig>obed</orig>
                  <reg>obedient</reg>
               </choice> humble Servant<lb/>
               <persName ref="./Personography.xml#EdgeM1">ME</persName>
            </closer>
            <closer>
               <dateline>
                  <date when="1834-07-04">July 4 1834</date></dateline>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
